<view class="map-page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view>
      <view class="eyebrow">MY FLIGHT NETWORK</view>
      <view class="page-title">飞行地图</view>
    </view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{yearOptions}}" value="{{yearIndex}}" bindchange="onYearChange">
      <view class="year-picker">{{selectedYear}} <text class="picker-arrow">⌄</text></view>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <view class="map-shell card">
    <map
      id="flight-map"
      class="map"
      latitude="{{mapCenter.latitude}}"
      longitude="{{mapCenter.longitude}}"
      scale="{{mapScale}}"
      markers="{{markers}}"
      polyline="{{polylines}}"
      include-points="{{includePoints}}"
      enable-zoom="true"
      enable-scroll="true"
    ></map>
    <cover-view wx:if="{{!loading && flights.length === 0}}" class="empty-overlay">
      <cover-view class="empty-icon">✈</cover-view>
      <cover-view class="empty-title">还没有飞行记录</cover-view>
      <cover-view class="empty-copy">记录第一段旅程，在这里点亮你的飞行网络。</cover-view>
      <cover-view class="empty-action" bindtap="addFlight">记录第一段旅程</cover-view>
    </cover-view>
  </view>

  <view class="stats-card card" bindtap="goToFlights">
    <view class="stat-block">
      <text class="stat-number">{{stats.flights}}</text>
      <text class="stat-label">飞行次数</text>
    </view>
    <view class="stat-divider"></view>
    <view class="stat-block stat-wide">
      <text class="stat-number">{{stats.distanceKm}}</text>
      <text class="stat-label">累计公里</text>
    </view>
    <view class="stat-divider"></view>
    <view class="stat-block">
      <text class="stat-number">{{stats.airports}}</text>
      <text class="stat-label">到访机场</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="route-note">
    <text class="note-mark">i</text>
    <text>地图路线为理论大圆航线；箭头仅表示出发 → 到达方向，不是飞机实时位置。</text>
  </view>

  <button class="primary-button add-button" bindtap="addFlight">
    <text class="plus">＋</text> 记录飞行
  </button>
</view>
